{"id": "q0212", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "aggressive", "tier": "aggressive", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 1609511243, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "c1188d4ab398808355719c420f025bd920b27aba798f5596eb328457a751cc63", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.5533501505851746, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 1, "query": "Using the definition of the unilateral Z transform, F (z) = ^\\infty\\sum_n=0 f[n] z^-n. find the z - transform of the step-sequence f[n] = u[n].\n\nA. [1 / (z - 1)]\nB. [z / (1 + z)]\nC. [z^2 / (z - 1)]\nD. [1 / (2 - z)]\nE. [(z - 1) / z]\nF. [1 / (z^2 - 1)]\nG. [1 / (1 - z)]\nH. [z / (1 - z)]\nI. [z / (z - 1)]\nJ. [z / (z^2 - 1)]\n\nAnswer with the correct option letter and its content.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0212.wav", "input_sha256": "cb0c43215556db43fa36a18e812d62c788eedc36caf1f0b4e579a75b19d2a79a", "input_samples": 383600, "input_s": 23.975, "n_real_chunks": 24, "score": 0.8433, "act": 0.9983, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "J. \\(\\displaystyle \\frac{z}{z-1}\\)", "expert_answer": "**J.** \\(\\displaystyle \\frac{z}{z-1}\\)", "transcript": "Using the definition of the unilateral Z-transform, F z equals sum n equals zero to infinity f n z to the minus n. Find the Z-transform of the step sequence f n equals u n. A. 1 z minus 1 plus z, z to the minus n, e z equals z, 1 minus z, f 1 z, 1 minus z, h z, 1 to z, i z, j, i z minus 1. Answer wi", "asr_s": 1.22, "expert_s": 5.38, "expert_input_samples": 383600, "expert_input_s": 23.975, "expert_input_sha256": "cb0c43215556db43fa36a18e812d62c788eedc36caf1f0b4e579a75b19d2a79a", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 4.677, "relay_synth_ms": 3600, "onset_chunk": 24, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 1, "feed_lag_max_ms": 875, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 875, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0212_a