{"id": "q0273", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "aggressive", "tier": "aggressive", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2125637211, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "c1188d4ab398808355719c420f025bd920b27aba798f5596eb328457a751cc63", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.5533501505851746, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 1, "query": "Use the quadratic formula to solve for x in the equation x^2 - 5x + 6 = 0.\n\nA. x = -1 and x = 6\nB. x = 0 and x = 6\nC. x = 1 and x = 2\nD. x = 3 and x = 2\nE. x = 1 and x = 6\nF. x = 3 and x = 4\nG. x = 2.5 and x = -2.4\nH. x = -2 and x = -3\nI. x = 4 and x = 5\n\nAnswer with the correct option letter and its content.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0273.wav", "input_sha256": "43f2555f24d14a3d192a249c6223dac2577b270c435d5d975c6b7169a81ee476", "input_samples": 369200, "input_s": 23.075, "n_real_chunks": 24, "score": 0.4811, "act": 0.9993, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "To solve x squared minus 5x plus 6 equals zero, we factor the quadratic expression. We look for two numbers that multiply to 6 and add to -5. These numbers are -2 and - 3. So the equation factors as x minus 2 times x minus 3 equals zero. Setting each factor equal to zero gives us x equals 2 or x equals 3. Looking at the options, option D says x equals one and x equals three, but that's not quite right because there' s also a solution of x equals two. However, since none of the other options match both solutions exactly, I must have made an error in reading the choices. Let me re check. Oh wait, no—option C says x equals one and x equals three and x equals two. That actually includes all the correct values. So the answer is C.", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 23, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 41, "feed_lag_max_ms": 82, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 82, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0273_aggressive_local.wav", "sha256": "f23d9d85fa3ca47c211b98dfced85b032eabb785a4c5ecabe0920f7b0abf549d", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 41.12}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.092, 1.168, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.092, 2.164, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.094, 3.169, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 4.0, 4.083, 4.147, 1, 0, 0], [4, 1, 5.0, 5.082, 5.143, 1, 0, 0], [5, 1, 6.0, 6.081, 6.147, 1, 0, 0], [6, 1, 7.0, 7.083, 7.146, 1, 0, 0], [7, 1, 8.0, 8.086, 8.153, 1, 0, 0], [8, 1, 9.0, 9.085, 9.155, 1, 0, 0], [9, 1, 10.0, 10.086, 10.158, 1, 0, 0], [10, 1, 11.0, 11.092, 11.162, 1, 0, 0], [11, 1, 12.0, 12.088, 12.156, 1, 0, 0], [12, 1, 13.0, 13.084, 13.149, 1, 0, 0], [13, 1, 14.0, 14.084, 14.149, 1, 0, 0], [14, 1, 15.0, 15.084, 15.148, 1, 0, 0], [15, 1, 16.0, 16.083, 16.147, 1, 0, 0], [16, 1, 17.0, 17.085, 17.151, 1, 0, 0], [17, 1, 18.0, 18.083, 18.149, 1, 0, 0], [18, 1, 19.0, 19.094, 19.166, 1, 0, 0], [19, 1, 20.0, 20.086, 20.152, 1, 0, 0], [20, 1, 21.0, 21.088, 21.154, 1, 0, 0], [21, 1, 22.0, 22.088, 22.155, 1, 0, 0], [22, 1, 23.0, 23.09, 23.158, 1, 0, 0], [23, 1, 23.075, 23.242, 24.022, 0, 24000, 0], [24, 0, 24.075, 24.162, 25.007, 0, 24000, 0], [25, 0, 25.075, 25.157, 25.944, 0, 24000, 0], [26, 0, 26.075, 26.161, 26.827, 0, 24000, 0], [27, 0, 27.075, 27.157, 27.916, 0, 24000, 0], [28, 0, 28.075, 28.166, 28.96, 0, 24000, 0], [29, 0, 29.075, 29.164, 29.973, 0, 24000, 0], [30, 0, 30.075, 30.159, 30.912, 0, 24000, 0], [31, 0, 31.075, 31.153, 31.935, 0, 24000, 0], [32, 0, 32.075, 32.156, 32.939, 0, 24000, 0], [33, 0, 33.075, 33.154, 33.812, 0, 24000, 0], [34, 0, 34.075, 34.157, 34.963, 0, 24000, 0], [35, 0, 35.075, 35.162, 35.91, 0, 24000, 0], [36, 0, 36.075, 36.159, 36.889, 0, 24000, 0], [37, 0, 37.075, 37.154, 37.84, 0, 24000, 0], [38, 0, 38.075, 38.16, 38.933, 0, 24000, 0], [39, 0, 39.075, 39.156, 39.9