{"id": "q0497", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "aggressive", "tier": "aggressive", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 3822138238, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "c1188d4ab398808355719c420f025bd920b27aba798f5596eb328457a751cc63", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.5533501505851746, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 1, "query": "提供三个市场营销活动的想法。", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0497.wav", "input_sha256": "2f39f9713ae0de2999899f625e5634b101feac7d7d12971e9ce00e43b2e7e4a3", "input_samples": 48000, "input_s": 3.0, "n_real_chunks": 3, "score": 0.1614, "act": 0.9977, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "好的，给你三个市场营销活动的想法。第一个是限时优惠促销活动。比如在特定时间段内推出折扣或买一送一的活动，通过社交媒体和邮件营销进行宣传，吸引顾客赶在截止日之前购买。第二个是联名合作活动。找一个同行业的品牌进行跨界合作，推出联名产品或专属套餐，利用双方的粉丝基础来扩大影响力。第三个是用户创意大赛。鼓励消费者提交与产品相关的创意内容，比如照片、视频或文案，优胜者获得奖品或公开展示机会，这样能增加参与感和传播度。", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 4, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 48, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0497_aggressive_local.wav", "sha256": "68f8c63d26553df048aac4cccf105a33eacd0432531953708c02c30ac165686a", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 47.84}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.083, 1.143, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.078, 2.139, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.079, 3.139, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 4.0, 4.076, 4.139, 1, 0, 0], [4, 0, 5.0, 5.086, 5.716, 0, 24000, 0], [5, 0, 6.0, 6.08, 6.791, 0, 24000, 0], [6, 0, 7.0, 7.078, 7.797, 0, 24000, 0], [7, 0, 8.0, 8.077, 8.717, 0, 24000, 0], [8, 0, 9.0, 9.077, 9.742, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 10.0, 10.08, 10.809, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 11.0, 11.082, 11.779, 0, 24000, 0], [11, 0, 12.0, 12.081, 12.801, 0, 24000, 0], [12, 0, 13.0, 1