{"id": "q0517", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "aggressive", "tier": "aggressive", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 717935425, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "c1188d4ab398808355719c420f025bd920b27aba798f5596eb328457a751cc63", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.5533501505851746, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 1, "query": "清洁白板的步骤：", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0517.wav", "input_sha256": "11df019a27a65af8e992536d1195d65d332d447e9cd16fa2d639bb62415ca0d3", "input_samples": 24600, "input_s": 1.538, "n_real_chunks": 2, "score": 0.4529, "act": 0.9868, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "首先用湿布轻轻擦去白板上的灰尘和干粉。然后喷上专用的白板清洁剂，或者用稀释过的中性清洁剂。用干净的超细纤维布均匀擦拭整个表面，避免用力过猛划伤板面。如果有顽固污渍，可以用干净的软毛刷轻轻刷洗一下。最后用干的超细纤维布再擦一遍，确保没有残留水迹或清洁剂。这样白板就能保持光滑亮泽了。", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 31, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0517_aggressive_local.wav", "sha256": "bb357dc209797c2cab5c5523c357268adad2d8f2303be60b4ca79d082449bfba", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 31.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.07, 1.128, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 1.538, 1.61, 1.668, 1, 0, 0], [2, 0, 2.538, 2.61, 2.667, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.538, 3.61, 4.284, 0, 24000, 0], [4, 0, 4.537, 4.607, 5.309, 0, 24000, 0], [5, 0, 5.537, 5.61, 6.257, 0, 24000, 0], [6, 0, 6.537, 6.608, 7.278, 0, 24000, 0], [7, 0, 7.537, 7.608, 8.257, 0, 24000, 0], [8, 0, 8.537, 8.609, 9.287, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.537, 9.611, 10.287, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 10.537, 10.611, 11.341, 0, 24000, 0], [11, 0, 11.537, 11.61, 12.304, 0, 24000, 0], [12, 0, 12.537, 12.611, 13.295, 0, 24000, 0], [13, 0, 13.537, 13.