{"id": "q0545", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "aggressive", "tier": "aggressive", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 3115533864, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "c1188d4ab398808355719c420f025bd920b27aba798f5596eb328457a751cc63", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.5533501505851746, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 1, "query": "用以下词语创作一首诗：周末，日出，第一。", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0545.wav", "input_sha256": "ed9f3c79abefa29521a589187281005e25d77e243bff98af3d1e2b1893c54133", "input_samples": 61800, "input_s": 3.862, "n_real_chunks": 4, "score": 0.4659, "act": 0.9853, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "周末的清晨，我醒来时分，天边初现微光。日出的光芒轻柔地洒落，驱散了昨夜的沉寂与迷雾。第一缕阳光穿过窗户，暖意融入心底，仿佛是大地在轻声低语。周末的节奏缓慢而自由，日出如诗般温柔，第一缕光芒点亮希望的梦。", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 4, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 37, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0545_aggressive_local.wav", "sha256": "2ddb31bde36d77038af78450451ef8bda27534edc6407905ffa94c377cfc6ff4", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 37.16}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.072, 1.13, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.074, 2.132, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.072, 3.13, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 3.862, 3.94, 3.999, 1, 0, 0], [4, 0, 4.862, 4.936, 5.577, 0, 24000, 0], [5, 0, 5.862, 5.94, 6.593, 0, 24000, 0], [6, 0, 6.862, 6.936, 7.591, 0, 24000, 0], [7, 0, 7.862, 7.939, 8.62, 0, 24000, 0], [8, 0, 8.863, 8.938, 9.557, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.863, 9.939, 10.529, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 10.863, 10.937, 11.553, 0, 24000, 0], [11, 0, 11.863, 11.943, 12.604, 0, 24000, 0], [12, 0, 12.863, 12.937, 13.61, 0, 24000, 0], [13, 0, 13.863, 13.94, 14.592, 0, 24000, 0], [14, 0, 